# inc-59lq: concentrate on an illusory ITEM (Phantasmal Force, arm 'i', so no
# illusory creature draws the goblin's blows), summon a goblin next to the
# caster, bump it, and wait while it hits the caster. Read by
# tools/check_concentration.sh for the blocked attack and the damage check.
#
# Wizard mode: "Wizard Mode Switches" row 11 is Freeze Monsters, which the
# frozen options file has ON; DOWN*10 SPACE turns it off so the goblin fights
# (the same switch tools/keys/sanctuary-strike.keys sets, the other way).
# Lowercase keys only; see concentration-core.keys.
@until "Select Spell" m
@choose "Phantasmal Force"
i
@expect "Target Illusion"
ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:started

w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*10
SPACE
ESC
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:goblin

RIGHT
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:attack
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t1
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t2
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t3
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t4
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t5
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t6
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t7
.
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:t8
